 "summary": "The chart integration formula for arbitrary measures, the chartwise ae/measurability/lintegral lemmas for positive density measures over a finite bundle atlas, and the Sobolev\u2013covector pairing have no counterpart in Mathlib or on main (existing chart integrals are Riemannian-specific; the private `continuousAt_innerSL_comp_symmL_trivializationAt` is pointwise, tangent-bundle-only and cannot replace the new lemma). The PR reuses `measure_eq_zero_iff_image_of_subset`, `exists_ae_eq_coord`, the `chartValueL_*` lemmas, the `MeasurableEmbedding` API, `aestronglyMeasurable_iUnion_iff`, `lintegral_iUnion_le` and `mkContinuousOfExistsBound` where applicable.",
